      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Darlington’s first log house, owned by Jamison Hamilton, appeared in 1836, marking the earliest permanent residence in the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darlington%2C_Wisconsin",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Mineral Point Railroad arrived in fall 1856, instantly linking Darlington’s farms to regional markets and sparking rapid growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
